==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Honedge|93}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*'''Pierce''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Kabuto|39}} and {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Anorith|27}}, both from the {{TCG|EX Sandstorm}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

